  "function_translated_nl": "Lesson context: lesson_05. Let triangle ABC be a triangle with sides AB = 14, BC = 16, AC = 10. Let segment MN be a midsegment segment. Let point M be a point on AB. Let point N be a point on BC. Segment MN is a midsegment parallel to BC and half its length. Find the length of MN.",
  "student_facing_prose": "You're a student working on triangle properties in a geometry course focused on dilations and midsegments. Here's your problem:\n\n---\n\nA surveyor is mapping a triangular plot of land, triangle ABC, with sides AB = 14 meters, BC = 16 meters, and AC = 10 meters. She wants to mark a smaller reference triangle by placing stakes at the midpoints of two of the sides: point M at the midpoint of AB and point N at the midpoint of BC. She then connects these two stakes with a string segment MN.\n\nBased on what you know about midsegments and dilations, what is the length of the string segment MN?"
}